              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Graces"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I notice that many recipes now call for self-rising flour which I never buy. So 2 cups of flour, 1 Tbs of baking powder, and 1 tsp of salt. (How many recipes call for one cup of flour?) Works for me and I am glad you published it.",
