            "reviewBody": "I needed self rising flour for a recipe I was making and looked up on this web site how to make it. I found that this recipe is too salty. After tasting my recipe, I looked up another site and it said to use 1/4 tsp salt for a cup of flour. The amount of baking powder was the same. Next time I will use half as much salt.",
